  "details": "Hello, for awhile now I've been getting frustrated with trying to pose and sit and such. Whenever I try to cock my head or lean around a corner, my body goes with my head. I was hoping to have a feature where you could choose a spot in your physical room to anchor your legs or waist or whatever so that you can move your head in more natural ways. I don't know if this is possible, but I'm too poor to afford full body tracking, so it'd be a nice feature",
